{
  "_about": "Single source of truth for Zitrone's visual assets. Humans edit this file + the assets/ master tree (clean kebab-case names). `scripts/assets-sync.mjs` copies masters into public/ and GENERATES the consumers: src/lib/assets.generated.ts (website imports assets by ID) and the deck registries (deck-system/data/*.json). Query `tags` to find the canonical image(s) for a topic — e.g. an AI building a coffee-machines one-pager filters tags for `equipment:coffee-machines`. EVERYTHING served lives under one tree, public/img/*: services/<section>/ (shared service + deck photography), clients/ (+ clients/mono), media/, brand/, food/, operations/, hero/, site/, service-detail/, testimonials/. Deck section photos are folded into the index automatically by scanning public/img/shared/services/<section>/.",
  "version": 1,
